  "goodToKnow": "Die Gesandtschaft is a legation, a diplomatic mission headed by a Gesandter (envoy), ranking below an embassy (die Botschaft) headed by a Botschafter. Today nearly all missions are embassies, so the word is mostly historical, or means a delegation sent somewhere. From senden (sandte, gesandt). The Vatican's mission is the Nuntiatur. Plural: die Gesandtschaften."
